     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear All,<div><br></div><div>Greetings to everyone</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">I am building an app where I need to add input panels and make entries. The entries should manifest itself into a reactive table. The added panels can also be deleted along with its entries. As such the reactive table should get expanded or retracted based on the addition and deletion of panels.</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">All this is ultimately saved into a R form.</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">My reactive table is only taking the values from one set of panels (the recent ones) and thus making an one row table. Also the update input is not working which is causing the app to crash( so commented out in the code).</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"></p><ol><li><b>How to handle the input ids of InsertUI to generate a reactive table and update inputs?</b></li><li><b>Is there any direct JS functions available for doing the similar things by using the input IDs?</b></li></ol><p></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">I am giving you the simple code with selection from three panels (added as a set of panels upon clicking Add). The Update button saves the entries into a R form.</p></div><div><br></div><div><u><font style=\"background-color:rgb(0,0,0)\" color=\"#ffffff\">I have attached the R script file to access the code</font></u></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">The errors produced in the code are as follows</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">Not able to think as to why this error, because the Scenario_Key is already a variable in the   Landuse_Values$DF.</p><pre style=\"padding:12px 8px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font